      "created_at": "2016-01-31T19:23:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Has anyone else noticed that the Engine of War art in the Freedom Six advert in game is different to the actual character card, when all of the others are extracts of the character panel?</p><p>It shows Graves fully inside the suit, operating it through a screen similar to some we've seen with Tyler Vance, complete with glowing hud displays, rather than in the broken remqins of the suit. The suit also appears much bigger than Graves rather than only just containing him as the original card art does.</p><p>Could this be the first glimpse of the revised art &gt;G have been saying is coming in the promo pack?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:21.846Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
